    },
    {
      "char": "alexisrhodes",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "This is exactly what happened to Jaden. Sudden acute fatigue seemingly brought on by dueling."
    },
    {
      "char": "jadenyuki",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "The question is, why now?"
    },
    {
      "char": "jesseanderson",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Remember what Jim said? About the weird energy? And how it’s being caused by our BioBands?"
    },
    {
      "char": "alexisrhodes",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Jim brings up a good point. I never thought of that."
    },
    {
      "char": "jesseanderson",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "And we can't get these things off!"
    },
    {
      "char": "alexisrhodes",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Let’s confront Viper about these BioBands!"
    },
    {
      "char": "alexisrhodes",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "jesseanderson",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "jadenyuki",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Meanwhile, Blair confronted her friend, Marcel Bonaparte, who hadn't been looking well."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "blairflannigan",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Marcel, slow down! Stop right there!"
    },
    {
      "char": "marcelbonaparte",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Oui oui."
    },
    {
      "char": "blairflannigan",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Where are you going? I cooked all night for you! It wasn’t for my health. It was for yours!"
    },
    {
      "char": "marcelbonaparte",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Can I get it to go? Don't you Americans like to eat fast food?"
    },
    {
      "char": "blairflannigan",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "That’s not funny! You need your energy back."
    },
    {
      "char": "marcelbonaparte",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Ah, I’ll pass."
    },
    {
      "char": "blairflannigan",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "More like you'll pass out! You're weak and you need food. Now eat!"
    },
    {
      "char": "marcelbonaparte",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Oui ma'am."
    },
    {
      "char": "blairflannigan",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "marcelbonaparte",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Adrian Gecko called the best students in the school together to announce a special tournament."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "For those of you who don’t know me, I’m Adrian. Thanks for showing up to my first ever “Duel for Jewels” shindig!"
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "And what's a tournament without a grand prize? It's my family’s most valuable possession! Ladies and gentlemen, I give you...the Jewel Disk!"
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Adrian let the students battle it out while he went searching for his own opponent."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Who to duel..."
    },
    {
      "char": "chazzprinceton",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "black_neutral",
      "text": "I can make that decision real easy for you, Gecko!"
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "char": "chazzprinceton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "black_anger",
      "text": "Your worst nightmare."
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "I gotta say...I like your style, bro."
    },
    {
      "char": "chazzprinceton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "black_goodnightssleep",
      "text": "First of all, my name's The Chazz! Second of all, what do you know about style? You've got purple hair and you're wrapped up in my mom's old living room curtains!"
    },
    {
      "char": "chazzprinceton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "black_smile",
      "text": "Well guess what? It's time for a makeover!"
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "What’s that s’posta mean?"
    },
    {
      "char": "chazzprinceton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "black_anguish",
      "text": "I’m not sure! Can we get on with this!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Why not. The sooner I beat you, the less bad dialogue I hafta hear!"
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "All right. You ready, Chazz?"
    },
    {
      "char": "chazzprinceton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "black_anger",
      "text": "The name is \"The Chazz!\""
    },
    {
      "char": "adriangecko",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Game on!"
    }
  ]
